#. module: mail
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/mail/static/src/js/tours/mail.js:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<p><b>Chat with coworkers</b> in real-time using direct "
"messages.</p><p><i>You might need to invite users from the Settings app "
"first.</i></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Txateatu lankideekin</b> denbora errealean zuzeneko mezuak erabilita.</p><p><i>Baliteke lehenbizi erabiltzaileak gonbidatu behar izatea Ezarpenak aplikaziotik.</p></p>"

#. module: mail
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/mail/static/src/js/tours/mail.js:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<p><b>Write a message</b> to the members of the channel here.</p> <p>You can"
" notify someone with <i>'@'</i> or link another channel with <i>'#'</i>. "
"Start your message with <i>'/'</i> to get the list of possible commands.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Idatzi mezu bat</b> kanaleko kideentzat hemen.</p> <p>Norbait aipatzeko, erabili <i>'@'</p>, eta beste kanal bat lotzeko, aldiz, <i>'#'</i>. Mezuen hasieran <i>'/'</i> jartzen baduzu, aginduen zerrenda ikusiko duzu.</p>"

#. module: mail
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/mail/static/src/js/tours/mail.js:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<p>Channels make it easy to organize information across different topics and"
" groups.</p> <p>Try to <b>create your first channel</b> (e.g. sales, "
"marketing, product XYZ, after work party, etc).</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Kanalei esker, erraza da informazioa gai eta talde desberdinen arabera antolatzea.</p> <p><b>Sortu zure lehen kanala</p> (adibidez, salmentak, marketina, XYZ produktua, lan osteko festa, etab.).</p>"

#. module: mail
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/mail/static/src/js/tours/mail.js:0
#, python-format
msgid "<p>Create a channel here.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Sortu kanal bat hemen.</p>"

#. module: mail
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/mail/static/src/js/tours/mail.js:0
